n DAU, cannot see the New Tab Weather widget. \n\nWe will introduce a new option for certain countries, allowing users to easily opt-in, or opt-out, of seeing Weather on their New Tab. We cannot use the initial Weather widget, as it relied on automatic detection of location to work, and in some cases we cannot legally auto-detect users\u2019 locations for any reason without their consent.","userFacingName":"HNT Weather opt-in feature for GDPR countries"}